      "PrimaryEffect": "The relabeled first button returns true; the dispatcher writes 256 to AppInterface + 4752 and returns true. MyApp Update subsequently returns exit status 2.",
      "SecondaryEffect": "The relabeled Retry button returns false. This dispatcher does not itself reconnect or authenticate.",
      "Localizations": [
